		{"id":"0e7f42155e5e4307","type":"text","text":"Agent 分工","x":-1920,"y":-462,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"4156b60bfdba71a7","type":"text","text":"角色定义","x":-1920,"y":-370,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"089f6082cf78551e","type":"text","text":"日志记录","x":-1920,"y":-1014,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"c5451450a321bb21","type":"text","text":"错误处理","x":-1920,"y":-922,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"5741dfba113bde34","type":"text","text":"Prompt 优化","x":-1920,"y":-830,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"1d72c4c858f036dd","type":"text","text":"性能优化","x":-1920,"y":-738,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"c208d5edd1e87d0e","type":"text","text":"协作模式","x":-1920,"y":-646,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"c55e8505c7b0878b","type":"text","text":"通信机制","x":-1920,"y":-554,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{
			"id":"23b81b2477036a23",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"在探索任何一个复杂概念时，我们最好从一个简洁的定义开始。在人工智能领域，智能体被定义为任何能够通过**传感器（Sensors）**感知其所处**环境（Environment）**，并**自主**地通过**执行器（Actuators）**采取**行动（Action）**以达成特定目标的实体。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1620,
			"y":23,
			"width":520,
			"height":138,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"7e2e5a9e002c6de7",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Hello-Agents\nhttps://hello-agents.datawhale.cc/#/./README",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":640,
			"y":720,
			"width":260,
			"height":120,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{"id":"030dfd5e32cf81ae","type":"text","text":"反应式智能体:恒温器,简单游戏NPC","x":3382,"y":-251,"width":260,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{
			"id":"e0dea6967ac714ed",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"规划式智能体:AlphaGo, 物流路径规划系统",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3382,
			"y":-160,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"0a83a55e1996208c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"混合式智能体: 自动驾驶汽车",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3380,
			"y":-70,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"401bbfbdbbb2a93a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"反应式->模型式->基于目标和基于效用",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3380,
			"y":-340,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"6886dc3aaad87635",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"符号主义AI (Symbolic AI)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3380,
			"y":130,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"49237ed8701f934a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"亚符号主义AI(Sub-symbolic AI)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3380,
			"y":20,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"8dbaa9c9935728d2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"神经符号主义AI (Neuro-Symbolic AI)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3380,
			"y":230,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"806fa85cc909f010",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"基于知识表示的分类",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3040,
			"y":130,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"05c81c96ae54e6d1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"智能体类型",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2700,
			"y":-160,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"fd5516c9a7fce2e3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"要理解智能体的运作，我们必须先理解它所处的**任务环境**。在人工智能领域，通常使用**PEAS 模型**来精确描述一个任务环境，即分析其**性能度量(Performance)、环境(Environment)、执行器(Actuators)和传感器(Sensors)** 。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1620,
			"y":237,
			"width":480,
			"height":122,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{"id":"95704090f5d8bd6e","type":"file","file":"image/Pasted image 20261110095138.png","x":1335,"y":161,"width":400,"height":69,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"dcb7ec6936e3e33f","type":"file","file":"image/Pasted image 20261110095200.png","x":2180,"y":421,"width":400,"height":122,"color":"2"},
		{
			"id":"d36c7fb3104df4c9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"这是循环的起点。智能体通过其传感器（例如，API 的监听端口、用户输入接口）接收来自环境的输入信息。这些信息，即**观察 (Observation)**，既可以是用户的初始指令，也可以是上一步行动所导致的环境状态变化反馈。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2660,
			"y":-12,
			"width":280,
			"height":125,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"07f16486df4dfdfa",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"接收到观察信息后，智能体进入其核心决策阶段。对于 LLM 智能体而言，这通常是由大语言模型驱动的内部推理过程。如图所示，“思考”阶段可进一步细分为两个关键环节：\n\n- **规划 (Planning)**：智能体基于当前的观察和其内部记忆，更新对任务和环境的理解，并制定或调整一个行动计划。这可能涉及将复杂目标分解为一系列更具体的子任务。\n- **工具选择 (Tool Selection)**：根据当前计划，智能体从其可用的工具库中，选择最适合执行下一步骤的工具，并确定调用该工具所需的具体参数。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2660,
			"y":130,
			"width":260,
			"height":130,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"8a7889f1cbd6af3a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"决策完成后，智能体通过其执行器（Actuators）执行具体的行动。这通常表现为调用一个选定的工具（如代码解释器、搜索引擎 API），从而对环境施加影响，意图改变环境的状态。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2660,
			"y":300,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"43b3d7c2419dab99",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"workflow和agent的区别",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2100,
			"y":580,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"cd1830a3ad1588c0",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Workflow 是让 AI 按部就班地执行指令，而 Agent 则是赋予 AI 自由度去自主达成目标**。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2400,
			"y":580,
			"width":400,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{"id":"5ba5cac174d3550c","type":"file","file":"image/Pasted image 20261110100434.png","x":2840,"y":420,"width":400,"height":275,"color":"2"},
		{
			"id":"403e99ed0b11366d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"基于大型语言模型的智能体是一个**具备自主性的、以目标为导向的系统**。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3340,
			"y":580,
			"width":300,
			"height":100,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"9b84a1d932a794b6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"工作流是一种传统的自动化范式，其核心是**对一系列任务或步骤进行预先定义的、结构化的编排**。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3340,
			"y":420,
			"width":300,
			"height":100,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"218ec86b23837320",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"规划与工具调用",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3740,
			"y":520,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"d1b4bef3c55a77cc",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"推理与决策",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3740,
			"y":600,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"17627ec7ce47ac50",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"生成结果",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3740,
			"y":680,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"2c04f06d8ab848df",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**这种基于实时信息进行动态推理和决策的能力，正是 Agent 的核心价值所在。**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":4060,
			"y":580,
			"width":280,
			"height":100,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{"id":"80c33bfb5ca98cd2","type":"file","file":"image/Pasted image 20261110102718.png","x":640,"y":446,"width":400,"height":189,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"f604ab5dafa469df","type":"file","file":"image/Pasted image 20261113095829.png","x":1460,"y":740,"width":444,"height":250,"color":"2"},
		{
			"id":"1b60a70e6851c6f6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Thought-Action-Observation",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1205,
			"y":680,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"e07e5668d7e8a2ce",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Agent = LLM + Harness\nLLM            Harness\n理解任务 +     Tool Context AgentLoop   Runtime\n自主决策     工具调用 上下文管理 执行循环 记忆 运行环境\n\n在此之上扩展 Memory RAG Skill 历史经验 外部知识 专业能力\n另一种概括: Agent = LLM + Tools + Memory + Planning\n把理解与决策转化为实际行动, 完成用户交给它的任务",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"shape":null
			},
			"x":1200,
			"y":451,
			"width":500,
			"height":229,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{"id":"651c31d1db4947fd","type":"file","file":"image/Pasted image 20261113100556.png","x":2260,"y":695,"width":490,"height":245,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"6fff04a55b69b69a","type":"file","file":"image/Pasted image 20261113171057.png","x":3040,"y":733,"width":585,"height":247,"color":"2"},
