		},
		{"id":"03682d54930408c3","type":"file","file":"image/Pasted image 20261113171434.png","x":3700,"y":40,"width":599,"height":420,"color":"2"},
		{
			"id":"3043fe8c2613ba3a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"必要性论断",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":4400,
			"y":-120,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"422189e313180497",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"充分性论断",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":4400,
			"y":-20,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"10df5e33df5f8f41",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"物理符号主义",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":4020,
			"y":-60,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"4e1eeceed2bffb4a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**任何展现出一般智能的系统，经分析后都将被证明是一个物理符号系统**。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":4720,
			"y":-145,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"f0eb04a210447503",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**任何足够大的物理符号系统，经过适当组织，都能够展现出一般智能行为**。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":4720,
			"y":-20,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"0c924bbeeed651a6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- **需要外部知识的任务**：如查询实时信息（天气、新闻、股价）、搜索专业领域的知识等。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3230,
			"y":1056,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"9eded62c9bef325a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- **需要精确计算的任务**：将数学问题交给计算器工具，避免LLM的计算错误。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3230,
			"y":1112,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"22486ac45b1e3046",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- **需要与API交互的任务**：如操作数据库、调用某个服务的API来完成特定功能。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3230,
			"y":1172,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"29054043b1f29035",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"在短路径有效",
			"styleAttributes":{},
