		},
		{
			"id":"cf7e4c1aaac2c173",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"[Plan and Reflection](Plan%20and%20Reflection.md)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2040,
			"y":1400,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"e6702ee7882fcab1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- **Thought (思考)：** 这是智能体的“内心独白”。它会分析当前情况、分解任务、制定下一步计划，或者反思上一步的结果。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2580,
			"y":1140,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"04e5614de9819d74",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- **Action (行动)：** 这是智能体决定采取的具体动作，通常是调用一个外部工具，例如 `Search['华为最新款手机']`。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2580,
			"y":1200,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"7a3dc33860fab003",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- **Observation (观察)：** 这是执行`Action`后从外部工具返回的结果，例如搜索结果的摘要或API的返回值。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2580,
			"y":1260,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{"id":"ea1a412f251d8e18","type":"file","file":"image/Pasted image 20261114091710.png","x":2710,"y":1404,"width":400,"height":48,"color":"2"},
		{
			"id":"4c524204fa6f6d5e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**理解目标 → 决策行动 → 执行工具 → 观察结果 → 调整决策 → 完成任务**",
