		{"id":"0a7fa5f1565009c5","type":"text","text":"ReAct","x":1790,"y":1160,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"b474f6030f85191d","type":"text","text":"Plan and Execute","x":1790,"y":1450,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"cfc6287a060c5770","type":"text","text":"Reflection","x":1790,"y":1542,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{
			"id":"73f0fc9638062b18",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"\n|             | **Plan-and-Solve (Prompting)** | **Plan-and-Execute (Architecture)**   |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------- |\n| **形态**      | 提示策略 / 推理增强                    | Agent 架构 / 执行范式                       |\n| **规划与执行**   | **紧密耦合**，在一次连续的模型生成中完成         | **完全分离**，由两个独立组件承担                    |\n| **计划的存在形式** | 模型生成文本的一部分                     | 系统可检查、可重试、可重跑的**数据结构**                |\n| **模型调用**    | 通常 **1 次**（规划+求解连续生成）          | 至少 **2 次**（Planner 1 次，Executor 逐步调用） |\n| **本质归类**    | **“带规划提示的 CoT”**               | **“真规划、真执行”的 Agent**                  |",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1570,
			"y":1220,
			"width":470,
			"height":180,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"d2881a6827250360",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**CoT（纯提示）→ ReAct（推理-行动交错）→ Plan-and-Execute（规划-执行分离）→ Reflection（反思自修正）→ Multi-Agent（多智能体协作）→ Workflow（DAG/状态机编排）**。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":942,
			"y":1406,
			"width":740,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{"id":"9d3047a1c702d7d3","type":"text","text":"Agent 架构模式与交互协议","x":1220,"y":1298,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2"},
