		{
			"id":"d045eb42a3d0e8bb",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"[[Agentic-RL#11.1 从 LLM 训练到 Agentic RL|从LLM训练到Agentic RL]]",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2842,
			"y":392,
			"width":260,
			"height":83
		},
		{
			"id":"271bd595981d9d45",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"[[Agentic-RL#11.1.1 从强化学习到 Agentic RL|从强化学习到Agentic RL]]",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3302,
			"y":191,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{"id":"81e0b39ec36bcc2a","type":"text","text":"API 服务","x":-1466,"y":803,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"6050b9df736d9415","type":"text","text":"Web 应用集成","x":-1466,"y":895,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"39eceeed866b87b6","type":"text","text":"监控和日志","x":-1466,"y":987,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{
			"id":"32e23dfbc1752a6b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"LangChain (基础组件库)：扮演“积木”的角色。它提供了构建LLM应用所需的基础模块，如模型封装、工具调用、记忆管理等。它是许多上层框架（包括LangGraph）的基础。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2438,
			"y":-1965,
			"width":310,
			"height":152
		},
		{
			"id":"5ab57cea04fde959",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- **AutoGPT (自主Agent先驱)**：一个**概念验证原型**。它展示了AI可以**自主**拆解目标、调用工具（如搜索、读写文件）来完成任务，是“自主Agent”理念的早期代表。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2460,
			"y":-1780,
			"width":312,
			"height":158
		},
		{
			"id":"73f2682a10a1e2f5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- **BabyAGI (自主任务管理)**：另一个**自主Agent的早期实践**。它通过任务优先级队列等机制，实现了任务的自动分解和执行，探索了Agent自我管理的可能性。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2490,
			"y":-1602,
			"width":362,
			"height":128
		},
		{
			"id":"370a969e6a529723",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- **LangGraph (LangChain生态的编排层)**：它同时出现在两组中，正说明了它的桥梁作用。当LangChain的线性“链 (Chain)”不足以表达复杂逻辑时，LangGraph用**图 (Graph)** 提供了更强大的编排能力，是LangChain生态的演进方向。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2490,
			"y":-1444,
			"width":412,
			"height":154
		},
		{"id":"a61599092b4da275","type":"file","file":"image/Pasted image 20261122111003.png","x":25,"y":3293,"width":1400,"height":640},
		{"id":"2a30e79442ede1e8","type":"text","text":"短期记忆","x":1870,"y":3941,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"4751310371080e1b","type":"text","text":"记忆系统 Memory","x":1300,"y":4033,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"c897a33bbbae1482","type":"text","text":"长期记忆","x":1870,"y":4033,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"bccf7bde0d37bcec","type":"text","text":"记忆检索和更新","x":1870,"y":4125,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{
			"id":"81336f8c009a1d09",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**工具 (Tools)** 就是其与外部世界交互的“手和脚”",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2157,
			"y":3147,
